### Variables
@host = http://localhost:8080/api

### 0. Health check
GET {{host}}/health

### 1. Registro (crea SIEMPRE con role "user", sin importar lo que mandes en el body)
POST {{host}}/sessions/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "first_name": "Pedro", "last_name": "Suarez", "email": "pedro2@mail.com", "age": 25, "password": "123456" }

### 2. Login (setea la cookie currentUser)
POST {{host}}/sessions/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "pedro@mail.com", "password": "123456" }

### 3. Login con credenciales invalidas -> 401 "Credenciales invalidas"
POST {{host}}/sessions/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "pedro@mail.com", "password": "incorrecta" }

### 4. Usuario actual (solo {id, email, role}, sin password) -> requiere estar logueado como pedro
GET {{host}}/sessions/current

### 5. Sin cookie -> 401 "No autenticado"
GET {{host}}/sessions/current

### 6. Logout
POST {{host}}/sessions/logout

### --- A partir de aca, logueate como laura@mail.com / 123456 (organizer) ---

### 7. Crear evento (requiere rol organizer o admin)
POST {{host}}/events
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Node Day", "description": "Charlas de backend", "category": "tecnologia", "date": "2027-03-10T18:00:00.000Z", "location": "CABA", "capacity": 2, "price": 0 }

### 8. Publicar evento (unico endpoint de cambio de estado)
PATCH {{host}}/events/<EVENT_ID>/status
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "published" }

### 9. Listar eventos publicados con filtros
GET {{host}}/events?category=tecnologia&location=CABA&sort=-date&limit=10&page=1

### --- A partir de aca, logueate como pedro@mail.com / 123456 (user) ---

### 10. Inscribirse (ruta anidada pedida por la consigna)
POST {{host}}/events/<EVENT_ID>/tickets
Content-Type: application/json

{ "quantity": 1 }

### 11. Mis tickets (populate sin password)
GET {{host}}/tickets/my-tickets

### 12. Cancelar inscripcion (PATCH, no PUT)
PATCH {{host}}/tickets/<TICKET_ID>/cancel

### 13. Inscriptos del evento (solo organizador dueno o admin)
GET {{host}}/events/<EVENT_ID>/tickets

### --- Ruta admin-only, logueate como admin@mail.com / 123456 ---

### 14. Listado de usuarios (403 si no sos admin)
GET {{host}}/users
